🎯 WHY THIS DECISION MATTERS
Voice + Executive use case has unique constraints that most agentic systems violate:

Constraint	Why It Matters	Pure Agent ❌	Context-Aware RAG ✅
Latency <6s	Voice = conversational	15-45s typical	3-6s
Determinism	Execs need same answer twice	Non-deterministic	Highly deterministic
Cost <$0.10/query	Exec usage = high volume	$0.50-$2.00	$0.05-$0.10
Auditability	Board-ready trust	Hard to trace	Every step logged
Failure mode	"Wrong number" kills product	Catastrophic	Graceful degradation
